<head>
<no><b>Part 1</b></no><heading guid="_ea75c6fe-f857-4b96-abde-3a66f521ab0a"
id="pt.1-he"><b>Preliminary</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6a0ad837-951d-4850-ae00-7f0936f58746"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_8324925d-2c39-46fb-b402-e3621996d8de"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref refid="act-2025-003"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Creative
Statement to Parliament Act 2025</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f5c09ff2-356b-4aab-acbe-1caee52d299f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_e4b22c72-b794-402c-aed9-c94bb7fc6a0e"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on the date of assent to this
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d6ec9a3c-7fa7-45e1-b473-126bf6462069"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_68bd4368-5061-40a6-9e62-e12b0ae6c495"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_01295317-f0e5-45f1-bf38-459c1fc47600"
id="sec.3-def.artsandculture"><b><i>arts and culture</i></b></defterm>
means&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3221e683-c699-47d6-9682-d16ed0ae191b" id="sec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">performing arts, including cabaret, circus,
comedy, dance, drama, music and theatre, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_96b50d4b-a97e-4fb3-9f34-0fcfcfcec8d6" id="sec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">visual arts and crafts, including drawing, mixed
media, painting, photography, printing and sculpture, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6e899a70-7e4a-438f-b9cd-85a0ec91b518" id="sec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">music, including classical and contemporary
composition, performance and recording, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_86bc0f30-d312-4d94-a68c-d60f0e0719b1" id="sec.3-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">literature, including fiction, non-fiction,
poetry and prose, published in books, newspapers and magazines, whether print
or digital, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2aab288e-8281-4891-b559-9c2c126678d4" id="sec.3-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">media arts, including broadcasting, news, radio
and screen and digital games.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_749ae2cf-4bbd-49bc-9b5c-8d6865ce556e"
id="sec.3-def.creativeindustries"><b><i>creative industries</i></b></defterm>
includes the following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c2bbf6e8-6531-4351-a39f-32a77cb38d74" id="sec.3-para1.a-oc.2">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the arts and culture sector,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3857e124-4db9-4079-b7b2-52152b4d6f06" id="sec.3-para1.b-oc.2">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the First Nations culture
sector,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7ee12c95-14b9-4d98-8b2b-febaf251d1e9" id="sec.3-para1.c-oc.2">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the cultural institutions sector, including
archives, galleries, libraries and museums,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a9f309b4-e230-4e8e-adf4-97cc0e732c09" id="sec.3-para1.d-oc.2">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the architecture, design and fashion
sector,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5b766b84-493d-4cf0-aeb3-6bbe9106e063" id="sec.3-para1.e-oc.2">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the built and physical heritage
sector,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_59f6ab98-c791-451a-9ce7-51ac7e8fa3f9" id="sec.3-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the arts and culture education
sector,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_17443a46-0128-48ba-9e96-7bdfbb261404" id="sec.3-para1.g">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">creativity in the food and beverage
sector,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2fae99e2-4fde-4f4c-9578-75921db6d8bd" id="sec.3-para1.h">
<no>(h)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">creative innovation in the technology
sector,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1d9c9bc7-8034-486d-97d1-34e3abd1f9ae" id="sec.3-para1.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">another sector or industry prescribed by the
regulations.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_10e07529-f419-4967-bb5f-b5394a3193d6"
id="sec.3-def.health"><b><i>health</i></b></defterm>, of the creative
industries, means sustainably positive economic, environmental, ethical and
operational conditions that support the long-term viability of the creative
industries for continuing social benefit.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_80f72de3-6d30-4118-965b-3ed22258563b"
id="sec.3-def.Statement"><b><i>Statement</i></b></defterm>&#8212;see section
5(1).</txt></block></deflist>
</block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_5a704a78-0d25-4534-97f4-2ba0ef6bc2fa"
id="sec.3-note"><heading guid="_b92f4ff2-0630-4317-ab05-59efeb5fa545"
id="sec.3-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref refid="act-1987-015" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation Act
1987</i></name></legref> contains definitions and other provisions that affect
the interpretation and application of this Act.</txt></block></note>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ce077213-14f3-43d6-8e08-45214b889790"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_46b01909-b3ff-41a1-8929-8f4ad6511204"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Objects of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4f8a51af-d1e7-42e1-9e1e-0b556121b42d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The objects of this Act are to&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_abaf653d-c856-4fa7-9b29-169e06df5080" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">recognise the intrinsic value of arts and
culture, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0f04fa27-9057-487f-a10e-fede601b3be6" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">acknowledge arts and culture are a public good
and the right to participate in the creative industries is a fundamental human
right, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d2c105aa-4d16-4a42-b942-ea1327811330" id="sec.4-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">promote Ministerial accountability in relation to
the creative industries in New South Wales.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fbd5713d-d0fa-4a8b-b93f-22d8c759e3f3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The objects are to be achieved by requiring the
Minister to report to Parliament about&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9e62c18f-3c09-4b2f-b9a6-094c0c93391e" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the status, health and progress of creative
industries in New South Wales, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d3eae3f4-ad44-4b9a-bc10-f5e5b159ce39" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">progress in implementing the Government&#8217;s
policies or plans relating to creative industries.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6969556d-84a2-44dc-b884-8a2380180aa9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_83eb4410-80ff-490b-b123-a37ac06d308c"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Creative Statement to Parliament</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4e21b00d-1179-4b48-8d22-ca269658f91f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_e04918eb-f781-4595-9149-ba876465e8fa"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Minister to prepare and table Statement</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0a86fea5-29a4-4997-8b39-15ba90fb4a09"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister must, for each 3-year period,
prepare a Creative Statement to Parliament (the <defterm type="definition"
guid="_947bef19-b7df-47f2-aa56-d80d673eed4d"
id="sec.5-ssec.1-def.Statement"><b><i>Statement</i></b></defterm>) about the
creative industries in New South Wales.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_44bc2dca-74f9-48d8-9255-1fc4b80eae01"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister must ensure a copy of the Statement
is tabled in each House of Parliament no later than 3 years after the last
Statement was tabled.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_74f59fb4-82f2-45d3-a148-413340743a7d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Statement must be made publicly available on
a NSW Government website no later than 7 days after being tabled in
Parliament.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7428d5fc-9526-44e1-ad32-eaeecec7ec0a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A House of Parliament may refer the Statement to
a relevant parliamentary committee within 7 days after the Statement is tabled
in the House.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8f47a71c-2025-4724-b5ed-13c5378cf0f7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A relevant parliamentary committee to which the
Statement is referred must report to the House that made the
referral.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cf14c9fd-0456-4c88-ad91-2ceee128822f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_0a567f4b-6b8b-437f-b06c-0fa061060079"
id="sec.5-ssec.6-def.relevantparliamentarycommittee"><b><i>relevant
parliamentary committee</i></b></defterm> means a committee of a House of
Parliament designated by a resolution by the House for this
section.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e59ec1e3-9a3a-49fe-9671-c54b9f3871bd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_85842ca5-19ad-4163-b7d9-b558bd15f2cc"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Purpose and contents of Statement</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_63154f78-d861-4982-b29b-756117fbfbe6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The purpose of the Statement is to report to
Parliament about&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0c901be1-eb52-4228-b921-32ca726bce64" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the status, health and progress of the creative
industries in New South Wales, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3ae9467c-1f48-4dad-a118-afc0e7bb6298" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">progress in implementing the Government&#8217;s
polices and plans in relation to the creative industries in New South
Wales.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9c90b7b6-7226-45b5-ae46-cf81662c69a8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (1), the Statement
must include the following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_956c1d1d-1bfa-4e8d-91c6-e1b9f43c202e" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a summary of the economic impact of the creative
industries in New South Wales, including an estimate of&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_73680e22-95e8-430e-9f55-cf3e6bbc1d37"
id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.a-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the contribution to the economy of the creative
industries, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bd29282b-19ad-4631-a749-d4b8a23e718d"
id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.a-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the number of jobs supported by the creative
industries, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f2b50f6e-ae2e-41bc-80d5-83b508f3949f"
id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.a-para2.iii">
<no>(iii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the forms of employment and other working
arrangements and employment characteristics of persons working in the creative
industries,</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b79f4c36-77f4-4a40-9895-ea029afe0485" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a summary of the activities and investment
undertaken by the Government to support the creative industries in New South
Wales,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0c301c4e-19ff-4fe9-b7d6-9a13384f06c9" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an assessment of the sustainability and growth of
the creative industries in New South Wales,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_02019fc6-8271-4502-9c2d-5340509f795f" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a report about progress in implementing
Government policies and plans relevant to the creative
industries.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f6f0708f-a129-4bd7-9d33-c85929e4757c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Also without limiting subsection (1), the
Statement may include the following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4ae5952a-1050-4731-b538-865a22f57156" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a summary of the creative industries in New South
Wales, including information about significant partnerships between the State
and&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7ed37c96-a22e-4c6d-9690-8cbbc9fd80a4"
id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.a-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Commonwealth, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_029d74bd-742a-4a1e-a1a8-7bccc0b5d8d1"
id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.a-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">local councils, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b0bcbb46-2b95-40e9-9fa1-42a733a7fe71"
id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.a-para2.iii">
<no>(iii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the private sector,</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_734186cf-cbef-4f3f-8a4b-292ea6a7ae99" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a summary of Government support for First Nations
creative industries in New South Wales, including reporting on&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b564074b-6ff5-465f-b80f-b02d3def51f0"
id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">direct support provided by the Government to
First Nations creative industries, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d6e7caa9-6b80-482a-ab13-e060957cd886"
id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">activities undertaken by the Government to
improve the participation of First Nations people in the creative
industries,</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c88d9fef-acd3-473a-94db-d6c0b78242fd" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a summary of the challenges, both real and
potential, facing the creative industries in New South
Wales,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_671ec918-f868-45ef-b750-c38d630c139d" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a summary of the opportunities, both real and
potential, available to support the creative industries in New South
Wales.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>
</level>


